    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Institute for Human Development held a workshop in Nairobi for education stakeholders to discuss effective ways of integrating Socio-Emotional Learning (SEL) into the Kenyan education system. The stakeholders in attendance were from Kenya's Nairobi, Turkana, Kajiado and Mombasa counties.",
